e yibe gafgow nagrad","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ma pi’in yibe gafgow nagrad e yad be gel’gel’ u fithik’ e amith.","poem":2},{"text":"Bay gu pi’ ngorad e re ayuw ni yad be yim’ ni bochan.”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Tin ma micheg SOMOL e rayag ni nge pagan’uy ngay;","poem":1},{"text":"bod feni fel’ e silber,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ni kan urfiy ke be’ech u mit e nifiy ni medlip yay.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Pi’in kireb e leam rorad e yad bay u gubin yang,","poem":1},{"text":"ma gubin e girdi’ nma uf ko n’en nib kireb.","poem":2},{"text":"A SOMOL, mu ayuwegmad,","poem":1},{"text":"u pa’ e miti girdi’ nem.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}